    <node id="英蓮">
      <data key="d0">英蓮</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">英蓮 is the daughter of 甄士隱, noted for being cherished despite the family's lack of male heirs.&lt;SEP&gt;英蓮 is士隱's daughter who goes missing, leading to distress for士隱 and his wife.&lt;SEP&gt;英蓮 is士隱's daughter, depicted as innocent and the center of her father's attention and affection.&lt;SEP&gt;英蓮 is士隱's daughter, portrayed as innocent and cared for.</data>
