    <node id="论语">
      <data key="d0">论语</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The Analects is a collection of sayings and ideas attributed to Confucius and his disciples, regarded as a crucial work in expressing Confucian philosophy.&lt;SEP&gt;《论语》记录了孔子的哲学思想，是儒家经典之一，其地位在历史上逐渐提升。</data>
