    <node id="孟子">
      <data key="d0">孟子</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Mencius is an important Confucian book that expounds on the concept of human nature being inherently good, following Confucius’s teachings.&lt;SEP&gt;《孟子》是继孔子之后的重要儒家著作，阐述了其性善论，地位逐渐提升。&lt;SEP&gt;《孟子》亦為儒家經典，記載了孟子思想，是對儒家學說的重要補充。&lt;SEP&gt;《孟子》是儒家學派的重要經典，延續了孔子的思想，並針對人性與道德進行闡述。&lt;SEP&gt;《孟子》是儒家經典之一，主要包含孟子及其弟子的問答，探討倫理和政治理念。&lt;SEP&gt;《孟子》是儒家經典之一，主要記錄了孟子和他的弟子之間的問答，探討倫理與政治的理念，是儒學重要的思想體系之一。&lt;SEP&gt;孟子, also known as Mencius, is a prominent philosopher and thinker in Confucianism, known for his teachings on benevolence and righteousness.&lt;SEP&gt;孟子, also known as Mencius, is a prominent philosopher in Confucianism, known for advocating the principles of benevolence and righteousness.&lt;SEP&gt;孟子是先秦時期的著名經學家，主張內在道德修養，強調內聖外王。&lt;SEP&gt;孟子是孔子的後繼者，他強調內在的道德修養，以德性為重，並對儒家思想有重要貢獻。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-778f057ebbb3f89bd1278c6c6c69bc3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c02f96884f421f06d459abb266d91550&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e06e41970449ac931423e76276bd2a5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-153bf19155c06ea022c365c26c3f7bd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a563a3e23fade380d6ab321c1b3ee82c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80d45d81c047e5d9ed7e6262bdc870be</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="汉代">
      <data key="d0">汉代</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Han Dynasty is a significant historical period in China that saw the flourishing of classical Confucian studies and the promotion of the Analects as crucial educational materials.&lt;SEP&gt;汉代是中国历史上一个重要的朝代，期间对《论语》和《孟子》的地位有显著提升。&lt;SEP&gt;The Han Dynasty represents a period in Chinese history when the status of '礼记' increased significantly in Confucian education and textual studies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-61c1e6a8981e6c1f6d0fa734c2df7c7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c02f96884f421f06d459abb266d91550</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="唐代">
      <data key="d0">唐代</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">The Tang Dynasty is a historical era in China where the Analects were officially recognized as part of classical studies, promoting the discussion surrounding Mencius.&lt;SEP&gt;唐代是中国历史上的一个朝代，期间《论语》已被纳入经部，而《孟子》的地位提升特别受到关注。&lt;SEP&gt;唐代是一個重要的中國朝代，在文化與學術發展上具有重大影響。&lt;SEP&gt;唐代是中國歷史上的一個重要朝代，對於經學的發展和擴展起到了關鍵作用。&lt;SEP&gt;The Tang Dynasty is noted as a period when《爾雅》was further codified and recognized as a significant text among the Confucian classics.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c02f96884f421f06d459abb266d91550&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a563a3e23fade380d6ab321c1b3ee82c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27f81217df36d68508a0377b44cc0233</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="宋代">
      <data key="d0">宋代</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">The Song Dynasty is a pivotal era in Chinese history when further advancements were made in incorporating Mencius into the Confucian canon.&lt;SEP&gt;宋代是中国古代的一个重要朝代，期间《孟子》最终被正式纳入经典书籍之中。&lt;SEP&gt;宋代是中國歷史上的一個主要朝代，經典文獻和學術活動在此期得到重視和發展。&lt;SEP&gt;宋代是中國歷史上的另一重要朝代，經學在此期進一步發展，經典數量增加。&lt;SEP&gt;宋代是中國歷史上的一個重要時期，以文化和經學的發展聞名。&lt;SEP&gt;The Song Dynasty, spanning from 960 to 1279, is known for its cultural and scholarly advancements, particularly in the realm of neo-Confucianism and classical studies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0e8683900122ec6ae46cbdea0097760d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a563a3e23fade380d6ab321c1b3ee82c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c02f96884f421f06d459abb266d91550&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bccd7f74cfb40acfe435a9254b38710b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="四书">
      <data key="d0">四书</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Four Books are fundamental texts in Confucianism, consisting of the Analects and Mencius, incorporated into the imperial examination system starting from the Yuan Dynasty.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c02f96884f421f06d459abb266d91550</data>
