    <node id="孔子">
      <data key="d0">孔子</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Confucius, known in Chinese as 孔子, is a significant philosopher and educator from ancient China and is recognized as the foundational figure of Confucianism. His extensive contributions to philosophy include the authorship and compilation of several influential texts, most notably the《春秋》 (Spring and Autumn Annals),《孝經》 (Classic of Filial Piety), and works related to《礼记》 (Book of Rites) and《诗经》 (Book of Songs). These texts have been pivotal in shaping moral virtues, political ideals, and educational practices throughout Chinese culture and history.

Confucius emphasized ethics, proper governance, and social harmony, laying the groundwork for moral and educational systems that influenced numerous dynasty periods. His interpretation of classical texts, such as the I Ching, and his compilation of essential literary works formed a cornerstone for the study of Chinese classics, earning him a reputation as a key figure in the evolution of Chinese philosophy. He is often regarded as "素王," underscoring his esteem in moral and historical consciousness.

As the founder of the Confucian school, Confucius’s thoughts significantly influenced later philosophers, including Mencius, and have left a lasting impact on Chinese culture, particularly in the realms of ethics and education. He is credited with organizing the "Six Classics," establishing a foundation for Confucian scholarship, and advocating for the use of poetry as a means of moral education. Overall, Confucius remains renowned as one of the most influential thinkers in ancient Chinese history, with teachings that continue to resonate in contemporary society.&lt;SEP&gt;孔子是《論語》的主要人物，代表了儒家思想，其教學對後世有深遠的影響。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5695efccc9909134c743fd87907cce18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-638cd24e31556238ab005c853f6859f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c02f96884f421f06d459abb266d91550&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ddf53d87bd692aeb35a6718692c1d26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d28f98cf8827f606528d98412d809e44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e8108d72a5081f3d3f6a324e51fc6b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20e1271e52dd123ca1fa46625046c3a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80d45d81c047e5d9ed7e6262bdc870be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59cdb6a393cf6e5bc510581f115196c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eaec9998840144f5983cb2a67a706cdc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb7fa3d9f1f3e12575d7613678d6e673&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7278dcffdedbc9d941ecc947495f58a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5203ee952df2751a57e4aa3f1835f80b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-778f057ebbb3f89bd1278c6c6c69bc3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d803640205d1c571a16954a8a6f3a902&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ab078e945b47999b74ddc9b6c51aeab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61c1e6a8981e6c1f6d0fa734c2df7c7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52ebc106dfc52070181208aa93df01ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-153bf19155c06ea022c365c26c3f7bd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58fb82d86881824f21309f0e3907017b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b637ef67bfcdd120eac3226ffb43049d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-241baa43e4f44425a3c025dd88c5c339&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e06e41970449ac931423e76276bd2a5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2082edaf6e5dc130e20d2ed96c0865c</data>
