    <node id="《儀禮》">
      <data key="d0">《儀禮》</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">《儀禮》 is a classical Chinese text discussing ceremonial rites and etiquette, providing foundational significance in understanding ancient Chinese culture and customs.&lt;SEP&gt;《儀禮》是古代儒家經典之一，紀錄了各種社會儀式與禮節的內容。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-58fb82d86881824f21309f0e3907017b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7278dcffdedbc9d941ecc947495f58a2</data>
