    <node id="漢朝">
      <data key="d0">漢朝</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">The Han Dynasty is a significant historical period in China, during which 《爾雅》 was considered a Confucian classic and gained prominence among scholarly works.&lt;SEP&gt;The Han Dynasty is a significant historical period in Chinese history during which《爾雅》was integrated into Confucian texts and gained greater recognition among scholars.&lt;SEP&gt;The Han Dynasty is a significant period in Chinese history when《孝經》was recognized and influential in the establishment of Confucian ideals as state philosophy.&lt;SEP&gt;漢朝, or the Han Dynasty, is an important historical period in China known for its cultural, political, and economic significance, especially in the development and annotation of texts like 《儀禮》.&lt;SEP&gt;漢朝是中國歷史上一個重要的封建王朝，代表了周統的真正繼承者，對中國文化和政治影響深遠。&lt;SEP&gt;漢朝是中國歷史上的一個朝代，以其對儒學的重視和經學的昌盛而聞名。&lt;SEP&gt;漢朝是中國歷史上的一個重要朝代，以其對儒學的重視和經學的昌盛而聞名，統治期間約為公元前206年至公元220年。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-59cdb6a393cf6e5bc510581f115196c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58fb82d86881824f21309f0e3907017b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2082edaf6e5dc130e20d2ed96c0865c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-315077752de6779a4597b96eec2f7e30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27f81217df36d68508a0377b44cc0233</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="周公">
      <data key="d0">周公</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">周公 is a historical figure believed to be the author of《周禮》, credited with establishing the rituals and institutions of the Zhou dynasty.&lt;SEP&gt;周公, or Duke of Zhou, is a historical figure associated with the establishment of various rites and is sometimes attributed authorship of ceremonial texts like 《儀禮》.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8b5b4639c5d9803bcd979d47f2e2790a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58fb82d86881824f21309f0e3907017b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="《周禮》">
      <data key="d0">《周禮》</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">《周禮》 is another ancient text that documents political systems and customs of the Zhou Dynasty, providing context and comparative analysis with 《儀禮》.&lt;SEP&gt;《周禮》是一部古代典籍，探討周代官制和社會習俗，其內容對後代政治具有影響。&lt;SEP&gt;《周禮》是一部古代文獻，詳細記載周代的官制及社會習俗，是研究古代政治的重要資料。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-944601eded74f0b3eb7a176c21225048&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58fb82d86881824f21309f0e3907017b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="《禮記》">
      <data key="d0">《禮記》</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">《禮記》 is a collection of writings on rituals that supplement the contents of 《儀禮》 and is considered crucial in the study of ancient rites.&lt;SEP&gt;《禮記》撰寫於孔孟之後，深入探討儀禮的象徵意義，是研究儒家思想演變的重要材料。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-58fb82d86881824f21309f0e3907017b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7278dcffdedbc9d941ecc947495f58a2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="鄭玄">
      <data key="d0">鄭玄</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">鄭玄 was a scholar during the Han Dynasty who extensively annotated《儀禮》, influencing its interpretation and study throughout successive generations.&lt;SEP&gt;鄭玄是東漢學者，對於經學的整合和注釋有重要貢獻。&lt;SEP&gt;鄭玄是東漢著名的經學家，對《尚書》的註釋與研究影響深遠。&lt;SEP&gt;鄭玄是東漢的學者，他對《左傳》的理解和推廣影響深遠。&lt;SEP&gt;鄭玄是東漢的學者，他對《左傳》的理解和推廣影響深遠，並與其他學者進行辯論。&lt;SEP&gt;鄭玄是東漢著名的學者，其學說在魏晉經學中具有重要地位，他與王肅之間的學術爭端被稱為鄭王學之爭。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-644b6b8418041c59b740ad3d9e291081&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58fb82d86881824f21309f0e3907017b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d81c900715eaf24c5541b45868f0d9f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eaec9998840144f5983cb2a67a706cdc</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
