      <data key="d2">倪天隐的理论贡献是义理派易学发展的关键，强调了易学的伦理和道德价值。</data>
      <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="周禮">
      <data key="d0">周禮</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">《周禮》 is an ancient Chinese text discussing the political system and rituals of the Zhou dynasty, serving as a foundational document in the study of Confucianism.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8b5b4639c5d9803bcd979d47f2e2790a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="禮記">
      <data key="d0">禮記</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">《禮記》 is a classical Chinese text that elaborates on the core meanings of rituals and serves as a complement to the more formal structures outlined in《儀禮》.&lt;SEP&gt;《禮記》撰寫於孔孟之後，深入探討儀禮的象徵意義，是研究儒家思想演變的重要材料。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8b5b4639c5d9803bcd979d47f2e2790a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7278dcffdedbc9d941ecc947495f58a2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="劉歆">
      <data key="d0">劉歆</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">劉歆 was a Han dynasty scholar credited with discovering ancient texts like 左傳, which contributed to its historical preservation.&lt;SEP&gt;劉歆 was a scholar during the Western Han dynasty responsible for revising and renaming《周禮》, impacting its historical reception.&lt;SEP&gt;劉歆是一位歷史人物，因將冬官誤納入地官而與《周禮》的解釋有關。&lt;SEP&gt;劉歆是西漢的歷史人物，將《周禮》正式納入經典，他的誤解影響了對《周禮》的解釋。&lt;SEP&gt;劉歆是漢代的學者，推廣古文《左傳》，並在宮中校理群書。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-644b6b8418041c59b740ad3d9e291081&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-944601eded74f0b3eb7a176c21225048&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d28f98cf8827f606528d98412d809e44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b5b4639c5d9803bcd979d47f2e2790a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="王莽">
      <data key="d0">王莽</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">王莽 was a Chinese historical figure who attempted to reform the Han dynasty's political system based on the principles outlined in《周禮》.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8b5b4639c5d9803bcd979d47f2e2790a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="北宋">
      <data key="d0">北宋</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">北宋 refers to the Northern Song dynasty, a period during which scholars like 王安石 sought to implement reforms based on ancient texts like《周禮》.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8b5b4639c5d9803bcd979d47f2e2790a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="清末">
      <data key="d0">清末</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">清末 refers to the late Qing dynasty, a time of significant political debate and reform influenced by works like《周禮》.</data>
