      <data key="d0">孔安國</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">孔安國 is identified as a scholar who played a role in the interpretation and dissemination of《周禮》 during the Han period.&lt;SEP&gt;孔安國是《論語》的古代研究者之一，對《論語》的命名及最早的考證有著重要作用。</data>
