      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">《孝經》 is a classic Confucian text that discusses the importance and principles of filial piety (孝道) and has influenced Confucian philosophy throughout history.&lt;SEP&gt;《孝經》 is a classic Confucian text that emphasizes the importance of filial piety and is significant in Chinese philosophy.</data>
