      <data key="d2">Zeng Shen, also known as Zengzi, is a disciple of Confucius and is associated with the teachings of《孝經》.&lt;SEP&gt;Zeng Shen, also known as Zengzi, is a disciple of Confucius and is often credited with the teachings and ideas that appear in《孝經》.</data>
