    <node id="《孟子》">
      <data key="d0">《孟子》</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">《孟子》 is a classical Chinese text that records the teachings and philosophies of the philosopher Mengzi.&lt;SEP&gt;《孟子》 is a significant classical Chinese text that encompasses the teachings and principles of the philosopher Mencius, often regarded as a foundational work in Confucian thought.&lt;SEP&gt;《孟子》 is a foundational text of Confucian philosophy that discusses morality and ethics, referring to Confucius's work in《春秋》.</data>
