      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">《漢書》 is a historical text from the Han dynasty that documents various aspects of Chinese history and literature, including Mencius' contributions.&lt;SEP&gt;漢書 is a historical text that provides a record of the history of the Western Han dynasty, authored by 班固, and contains mentions of various classical texts.</data>
