    <node id="《論語》">
      <data key="d0">《論語》</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">《論語》 is a collection of sayings and ideas attributed to Confucius, often compared to Mencius' teachings for their mutual emphasis on morality.&lt;SEP&gt;《論語》 is a collection of teachings and ideas of Confucius that was placed alongside《爾雅》 in academic studies during the Han Dynasty.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-27f81217df36d68508a0377b44cc0233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80d45d81c047e5d9ed7e6262bdc870be</data>
