    <node id="東漢">
      <data key="d0">東漢</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">The Eastern Han period is marked by a decline in the prominence of《穀梁傳》，reflecting broader trends in Chinese scholarship.&lt;SEP&gt;東漢 refers to the Eastern Han Dynasty, a historical period in China that influenced the transmission and writing of Confucian classics including the 《春秋公羊傳》.&lt;SEP&gt;東漢時期是中國歷史上的一個重要時期，對《公羊傳》的早期注解和研究做出了重要貢獻。&lt;SEP&gt;東漢是中國歷史上的一個時期，對後來的魏晉經學產生深遠影響。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3bea4490eb61231f589eef887f6ca7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-638cd24e31556238ab005c853f6859f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eaec9998840144f5983cb2a67a706cdc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2082edaf6e5dc130e20d2ed96c0865c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="公羊家族">
      <data key="d0">公羊家族</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">公羊家族 is the lineage responsible for compiling and editing the 《春秋公羊傳》 during the reign of Emperor Jing of Han. Their work was significant in shaping Confucian discourse.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-638cd24e31556238ab005c853f6859f2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="司馬遷">
      <data key="d0">司馬遷</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">司馬遷 is a historical scholar credited with the compilation of 史記, which includes references to the authorship of left-leaning texts like 左傳.&lt;SEP&gt;司馬遷 is an influential Chinese historian who contributed significantly to historical writing and had perspectives on the moral teachings presented in the 《春秋公羊傳》.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d28f98cf8827f606528d98412d809e44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-638cd24e31556238ab005c853f6859f2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="董仲舒">
      <data key="d0">董仲舒</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">董仲舒 is a historical figure and author of '蘇舆義證', contributing to classical literature.&lt;SEP&gt;董仲舒 was a prominent scholar and philosopher during the Han Dynasty, known for his theories on the interrelation of history and governance as presented in the teachings of the 《春秋公羊傳》.&lt;SEP&gt;董仲舒是漢代著名的學者，主張以天命思想解釋新王朝的成立，對儒學發展具有重要影響。&lt;SEP&gt;董仲舒 is a significant Han dynasty scholar who integrated Confucian thought with cosmological concepts such as 陰陽 and 五行.&lt;SEP&gt;董仲舒 is another notable Han dynasty scholar, known for his integration of Confucianism with cosmological concepts including the Theory of Yin-Yang and Five Elements.&lt;SEP&gt;董仲舒是漢武帝的國師，他的意見導致儒學成為官方學說。&lt;SEP&gt;董仲舒是漢武帝的顧問，他提倡儒學成為官方思想，對後續的經學發展影響深遠。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5695efccc9909134c743fd87907cce18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-638cd24e31556238ab005c853f6859f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2082edaf6e5dc130e20d2ed96c0865c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c564be59b570b8e18755b12a076c0eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-315077752de6779a4597b96eec2f7e30</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="何休">
      <data key="d0">何休</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">何休 was a scholar during the Eastern Han period who contributed to the understanding and interpretation of the 《春秋公羊傳》 through his writings.&lt;SEP&gt;何休是東漢的重要學者，他對《公羊傳》的著作影響深遠，並且是引介詮釋經典的重要人物。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-638cd24e31556238ab005c853f6859f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2082edaf6e5dc130e20d2ed96c0865c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
