      <data key="d0">春秋之微言幽旨</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">春秋之微言幽旨 refers to the subtle teachings and profound meanings extracted from the Spring and Autumn Annals, emphasizing moral distinctions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-638cd24e31556238ab005c853f6859f2</data>
