    </node>
    <node id="穀梁傳">
      <data key="d0">穀梁傳</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">穀梁傳 is a significant commentary on the Book of Spring and Autumn, providing interpretations and insights into the text that complement the perspectives presented in the 《公羊傳》.&lt;SEP&gt;穀梁傳 is similar to 公羊傳, offering interpretations and insights into the moral implications of the 春秋.&lt;SEP&gt;穀梁傳 is an ancient Chinese text related to Confucian studies, providing interpretations of the Spring and Autumn Annals.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-59a277b6257718be853a40a0397f6347&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d28f98cf8827f606528d98412d809e44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-638cd24e31556238ab005c853f6859f2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="漢景帝">
      <data key="d0">漢景帝</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">漢景帝 was the Emperor of the Western Han Dynasty, under whose reign significant works, including the 《春秋公羊傳》, were compiled and edited.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-638cd24e31556238ab005c853f6859f2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="微言大義">
      <data key="d0">微言大義</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">微言大義 refers to the subtle and profound meanings found in Confucian texts, often requiring deep interpretation and analysis.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-638cd24e31556238ab005c853f6859f2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="三統說">
      <data key="d0">三統說</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">三統說 is a theory proposed by 董仲舒 that describes the cyclical nature of governance and moral authority through different dynasties in Chinese history.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-638cd24e31556238ab005c853f6859f2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="三世說">
      <data key="d0">三世說</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">三世說 is a historical theory articulated by 董仲舒 which outlines the conditions of governance during different eras and the evolving nature of power.&lt;SEP&gt;三世說是解釋孔子作《春秋》依據的三個歷史階段，分為所見世、所聞世和所傳聞世。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-638cd24e31556238ab005c853f6859f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2082edaf6e5dc130e20d2ed96c0865c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="異外內">
      <data key="d0">異外內</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">異外內 is a concept related to the relationships and distinctions between internal and external influences in governance, discussed in the context of Confucian philosophy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-638cd24e31556238ab005c853f6859f2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="公羊傳">
      <data key="d0">公羊傳</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">《公羊傳》 is another commentary on the Spring and Autumn Annals, noted for its interpretations and moral insights, compared with《穀梁傳》.&lt;SEP&gt;《公羊傳》是對《春秋》的解釋性著作，闡述孔子的政治理念及其對歷史的觀點，受到後世儒學的重視。&lt;SEP&gt;公羊傳 is another commentary related to the 春秋, focusing on specific interpretations of the text's meanings and principles.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3bea4490eb61231f589eef887f6ca7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d28f98cf8827f606528d98412d809e44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2082edaf6e5dc130e20d2ed96c0865c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="清代">
      <data key="d0">清代</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">The 'Qing Dynasty' (1644-1912) saw enhanced scholarly interest in '诗经', fostering debates on poetry's role in education and morality among Confucian scholars.&lt;SEP&gt;The 'Qing Dynasty' marked a period of scholarly interest in '诗经', where both contemporary and ancient interpretations were examined and debated among scholars.&lt;SEP&gt;清代是中國歷史上一個重要的王朝，該時期的學者對詩經及古典文學的研究進行了深入探討。&lt;SEP&gt;清代是中國歷史上的一個時期，對文學與文化有重大影響。&lt;SEP&gt;清代是中國歷史最後一個封建王朝，強調經典文獻的收集和研究。&lt;SEP&gt;清代是中國歷史的一個朝代，在此時《公羊傳》的學術復興對孔子思想進行了重新詮釋和推廣。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b2082edaf6e5dc130e20d2ed96c0865c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52ebc106dfc52070181208aa93df01ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bccd7f74cfb40acfe435a9254b38710b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d803640205d1c571a16954a8a6f3a902</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="莊存與">
      <data key="d0">莊存與</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">莊存與是清代的學者，他參與了公羊學的復興，並對《公羊傳》的重要性進行了闡釋。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b2082edaf6e5dc130e20d2ed96c0865c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
