    <node id="杜預">
      <data key="d0">杜預</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">杜預 (Du Yu) was a renowned figure in the Jin Dynasty credited with the early integration of the '左傳' with the '春秋經', marking a milestone in classical Chinese literature.&lt;SEP&gt;杜預 is a historical figure mentioned as an important commentator on the 春秋, particularly through his work in the 晋 dynasty.&lt;SEP&gt;杜預是東晉時期的學者，在《左傳》研究上有著重要的位置，著有《春秋經傳集解》。&lt;SEP&gt;杜預是東晉的一位學者，以其對《春秋》的註解及學術貢獻而著稱。&lt;SEP&gt;杜預是東晉的學者，以其對《春秋》的注解和解釋在學術界扮演重要角色。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-644b6b8418041c59b740ad3d9e291081&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d28f98cf8827f606528d98412d809e44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e74e5db74fe2456c8fa8b095134e9920&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bccd7f74cfb40acfe435a9254b38710b</data>
