    <node id="春秋經">
      <data key="d0">春秋經</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The '春秋經' (Spring and Autumn Annals) is a historical text compiled by Confucius that reflects the events in the state of Lu and integrates his philosophical insights.&lt;SEP&gt;《春秋經》是孔子整理的歷史書，並被視為重要的學術著作。&lt;SEP&gt;《春秋經》由孔子整理，形成了六經的完整體系，對後世經學發展有重大影響。&lt;SEP&gt;春秋經 (Spring and Autumn Annals) is a historical chronicle that is foundational to Chinese historiography and is referenced alongside works like '左傳' and commentaries by '公羊' (Gongyang) and '穀梁' (Guliang).</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e06e41970449ac931423e76276bd2a5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5695efccc9909134c743fd87907cce18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e74e5db74fe2456c8fa8b095134e9920&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-778f057ebbb3f89bd1278c6c6c69bc3a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
