      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="理學">
      <data key="d0">理學</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">理學 is a philosophical school that emerged during the Song Dynasty, focusing on metaphysical concepts, ethics, and the cultivation of personal character.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0e8683900122ec6ae46cbdea0097760d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="四書章句集注">
      <data key="d0">四書章句集注</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Four Books with Commentary is a collection of commentaries by 朱熹 that became a foundational text for civil service exams in the Yuan Dynasty.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0e8683900122ec6ae46cbdea0097760d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="疑經改經">
      <data key="d0">疑經改經</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">疑經改經 is a scholarly trend during the Song Dynasty wherein scholars questioned the authenticity of classical texts and suggested revisions to correct perceived inaccuracies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0e8683900122ec6ae46cbdea0097760d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="心性之學">
      <data key="d0">心性之學</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">心性之學 is a philosophical approach emphasizing the importance of understanding the nature of the mind and its relation to moral character and the universe in neo-Confucianism.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0e8683900122ec6ae46cbdea0097760d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="政治">
      <data key="d0">政治</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">政治 encompasses the governance structures and political stability of the Song Dynasty, which allowed for cultural and intellectual advancements.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0e8683900122ec6ae46cbdea0097760d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
    </node>
    <node id="《中庸》">
      <data key="d0">《中庸》</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">《中庸》, or the Doctrine of the Mean, is another fundamental Confucian text discussed and analyzed in the context of Song Dynasty philosophy.</data>
