      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">俞樾 is a late Qing scholar known for his contributions to ancient Confucian literature and for inheriting the methodologies of 顧炎武.&lt;SEP&gt;俞樾 is a researcher in ancient literature who inherits and further develops the methodologies of 顧炎武 in the late Qing.</data>
