    <node id="诗经">
      <data key="d0">诗经</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The '诗经' or 'Book of Songs' is one of the oldest collections of Chinese poetry, containing songs and poems that reflect social life, rituals, and cultural values.&lt;SEP&gt;The '诗经' or 'Book of Songs' is one of the oldest collections of Chinese poetry, containing songs and poems that reflect various aspects of social life and rituals.</data>
